Lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender and queer ([[wikipedia:LGBTQ|LGBTQ]]) people in [[Qym]] face legal and social challenges that are not experienced by non-LGBTQ residents. While both male and female same-sex sexual activity are legal, same-sex couples are currently unable to marry or adopt, but same-sex [[wikipedia:unregistered cohabitation|unregistered cohabitation]] is recognized since {{abbr|2419|2008.7 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, offering some basic protections. 

